                {
                    "name": "callback",
                    "type": "function",
                    "ref": false,
                    "prototype": {
                        "name": "UserLoadedCallback",
                        "funcName": "UserLoadedCallback",
                        "description": "Called when a user's data has been fully loaded. This callback is triggered after a storage extension has completed loading and applying the user's persistent data (e.g. groups, permissions, metadata). At this stage, the user is considered fully initialized and ready for normal operation within the system. Identifier of the plugin that reports the completion of the loading process. PlayerID of the user whose data has been loaded. Indicates whether the user's data was loaded without user presence on server. Called when a user's data has been fully loaded. This callback is triggered after a storage extension has completed loading and applying the user's persistent data (e.g. groups, permissions, metadata). At this stage, the user is considered fully initialized and ready for normal operation within the system. Identifier of the plugin that reports the completion of the loading process. PlayerID of the user whose data has been loaded. Indicates whether the user's data was loaded without user presence on server.",
